{"architectures":["neutral","x64"],"id":"calibre.calibre.portable","latestVersion":"8.12.0.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Portable version of Calibre, a powerful and easy to use e-book manager","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/raw/master/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Portable version of Calibre, a powerful and easy to use e-book manager","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/raw/master/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Calibre is an e-book manager.\nIt can view, convert, edit and catalog e-books in all of the major e-book formats.\nIt can also talk to e-book reader devices.\nIt can go out to the internet and fetch metadata for your books.\nIt can download newspapers and convert them into e-books for convenient reading.\nIt is cross platform, running on Linux, Windows and macOS.","moniker":"calibre-portable","name":"calibre portable","packageUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre","publisher":"calibre-ebook.com","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/releases/tag/v8.12.0","tags":["calibre","ebook","epub","kindle","kobo","library","mobi"]}},"longDescription":"Calibre is an e-book manager.\nIt can view, convert, edit and catalog e-books in all of the major e-book formats.\nIt can also talk to e-book reader devices.\nIt can go out to the internet and fetch metadata for your books.\nIt can download newspapers and convert them into e-books for convenient reading.\nIt is cross platform, running on Linux, Windows and macOS.","moniker":"calibre-portable","name":"calibre portable","packageUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre","publisher":"calibre-ebook.com","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/releases/tag/v8.12.0","tags":["calibre","ebook","epub","kindle","kobo","